_refine.details                                  
;Authors state that because crystals were small and subject to high radiation dosages during data collection, difference fouriers comparing the initial and final swatches of data were inspected to identify radiation-induced disulfide breakage, and the refined models were adjusted to reflect the initial, radiation-damage free structure. HYDROGENS HAVE BEEN ADDED IN THE RIDING POSITIONS.
